# Staged copy of the repo-root blueprint shelf, produced by
# `scripts/stage-blueprint-shelf.mjs` as part of the `prepack` /
# `prepublishOnly` scripts so `npm pack` ships the shelf inside the
# package. The authoritative shelf lives at the repo root.
#
# Root-anchored (leading '/') so this rule only matches
# `packages/rcf-lite/blueprints/` and does not swallow every nested
# `blueprints/` directory (e.g. the library-authoring fixture at
# `test/fixtures/library-authoring-example/blueprints/`).
/blueprints/
